                        "entry_id": "c4e7ea5f-6963-35e0-93b8-497a2464c8d8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Political support for black people."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated",
                            "derogatory",
                            "ethnic",
                            "offensive",
                            "slur",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b1c3339-d981-475c-83b2-0f51d9722019",
                                "sense_id": "ca52eb76-b3ea-38b4-af6d-0f6ad2313818",
                                "text": "\"We represent the majority of the people in Alabama who hate niggerism, Catholicism, Judaism, and all the -isms of the whole world.\" So said Robert Creel of the Alabama Klu Klux Klan. He also said, \"I like Barry Goldwater. He needs our help.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4110c7fc-1de6-467a-aac0-c4c969454665",
                                "sense_id": "ca52eb76-b3ea-38b4-af6d-0f6ad2313818",
                                "text": "Their black support confirmed the charge of \"niggerism\" and helped the Democrats turn the widespread Negrophobia to their account."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ca47f2a-aa6a-4445-8b67-b341e26f4899",
                                "sense_id": "ca52eb76-b3ea-38b4-af6d-0f6ad2313818",
                                "text": "The spot quoted a Klan official saying, \"In Alabama, we hate niggerism, Catholicism, and Judaism.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f0388611-c04a-3659-959d-9647f9b27a62",
                        "entry_id": "c4e7ea5f-6963-35e0-93b8-497a2464c8d8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something characteristic of black people."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "dated",
                            "derogatory",
                            "ethnic",
                            "offensive",
                            "slur"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "43c94267-fd73-4cdb-8687-71668103dc52",
                                "sense_id": "f0388611-c04a-3659-959d-9647f9b27a62",
                                "text": "He loved their tricks of language, loved to pick up and feel and taste new words from their rich reservoir of niggerisms."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f877ea3-2e08-4aa9-a3fd-a4c0d009545a",
                                "sense_id": "f0388611-c04a-3659-959d-9647f9b27a62",
                                "text": "But as it was, not until the 1940s did the industry begin to depart significantly from the stereotypes with their \"insulting niggerisms\"..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
